{"id":"aparte","lemma":"aparte","pos":"adv","rank":1385,"glosses":["separately, apart (usually followed by de)","aside, aside from (when followed by de)"],"ipa":"/aˈpaɾte/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-aparte.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es cuestión aparte.","en":"That's another issue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454219","words":[null,null,{"g":"matter"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"No sé nada aparte de esto.","en":"I know nothing but this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707288","words":[null,null,{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"No vi a nadie aparte de ti.","en":"I've seen nobody except you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608504","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"no one"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"}]},{"text":"Aquí no había nadie aparte de mí.","en":"There was no one here but me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1154837","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"no one"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Sé muy poco aparte de eso.","en":"I know very little beyond that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/297760","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},null,{"g":"little, not much"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]}]}